{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"Wiki. "},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Grothendieck 函数–层字典"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“Grothendieck 函数–层字典”"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>对于一个可构造 "},{"Local":{"url":"l-进层","text":"l-进层"}},{"Plain":", 取其 $\\mathbb F_{q^m}$-点处的茎上 [Frobenius 共轭类](Frobenius 共轭类.md)的迹, 即得到 $\\mathbb F_{q^m}$-点的集合上的一个函数. 更一般地, 对于 "},{"Local":{"url":"l-进层","text":"l-进层"}},{"Plain":"的复形, 取 [Frobenius 共轭类](Frobenius 共轭类.md)的迹的交错和.</p>\n<p>层 (复形) 到函数的对应与一些操作相容:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>层的拉回对应函数的拉回,</li>\n<li>紧支集层的推前对应函数的逐纤维积分. ([Grothendieck–Lefschetz 迹公式](Grothendieck–Lefschetz 迹公式.md))</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在 "},{"Local":{"url":"l-进层","text":"l-进层"}},{"Plain":"的导出范畴中, 我们希望找一个 [Abel 范畴](Abel 范畴.md)使得层 (复形) 到函数的对应为单射. 答案是"},{"Local":{"url":"偏屈层","text":"偏屈层"}},{"Plain":"的范畴.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p><strong>例</strong>. $\\mathrm{GL}_n(F)\\backslash\\mathrm{GL}_n(\\mathbb A) / \\mathrm{GL}_n(\\mathcal O)$ 上的非分歧自守函数对应"},{"Local":{"url":"主丛的模空间","text":"主丛的模空间"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathrm{Bun}_n$ 上的偏屈层.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Assigning to a perverse sheaf its “trace of Frobenius” function, we obtain an iden tification between the Grothendieck group of $\\mathcal P_{G(\\mathcal O)}$ and the algebra of $G(\\mathcal O)$–invariant functions on $G(F)/G(\\mathcal O)$, i.e., the spherical Hecke algebra. In that sense, $\\mathcal P_{G(\\mathcal O)}$ is a <strong>categorification</strong> of the Hecke algebra. — Frenkel, Recent Advances in the Langlands Program</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"佐武等价","text":"佐武等价"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}